  },
  {
   "@id": "http://localhost:8080/how-much-do-movers-cost/#faq",
   "@type": "FAQPage",
   "mainEntity": [
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Start with how much do movers cost for your home size and distance, then add what sits outside that price: packing, supplies, tips and any storage. For a local 2-bedroom move, the movers' part is $720–$1,800 at 10 road miles, off peak, with no stairs or extras. Stairs or a summer date raise the range itself, so budget at the top of it or above."
     },
     "name": "How much should you budget for a move?"
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "The usual extras are stairs, a long carry from the door to the truck, an elevator, a shuttle truck where a big truck can't park, travel time and fuel. Packing materials, storage and full-value protection are priced separately too. Ask the mover to list every fee in the written estimate, so how much do movers cost on moving day matches what you agreed."
     },
     "name": "What hidden fees can raise how much do movers cost?"
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Tipping is up to you. Moving guides suggest a tip per mover for a half day or a full day, a larger daily tip for a long-distance crew, or a share of the bill. The tip calculator on this page works those published ranges out for your crew."
     },
     "name": "How much should you tip movers?"
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "No. An online estimate, like the calculator on this page, shows how much do movers cost for a move like yours. A firm price is the mover's written estimate, made after it has seen your belongings in person or by video. Use the online estimate to spot a mover's price that looks far too low or too high."
     },
     "name": "Is an online moving cost estimate the same as a quote?"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}